{"3878420": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "MEKANION", "steam_appid": 3878420, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Defeat Mekanions, the mechanical lifeforms consuming the entire world!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a new recruit of &quot;Clan,&quot; a global organization. The Clan's mission is to eliminate Mekanions—mechanically-infested lifeforms appearing in dungeons that have emerged across the world!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow stronger by learning skills at your Clan branch, crafting custom equipment, and completing various missions! The stronger you become, the more powerful Mekanions you will face.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Growth System Through Missions</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Accept and complete missions from various NPCs at your Clan branch to accumulate accolades.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you reach certain accolade thresholds, your Agent Rank increases along with your stats and skill points.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Additionally, completing specific missions unlocks new regions, sectors, and dungeons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dungeon Clearing Gameplay Structure</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you clear each dungeon, you obtain contribution, credits, cores, and materials.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Custom Equipment</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft your own unique equipment using materials obtained from defeating Mekanions and rare cores.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The performance of your crafted equipment increases based on the materials and cores used, and you gain special options.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diverse Skill Combinations</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Express your unique character through various choices within the skill tree divided into common skills and weapon skills!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can further enhance your unique style through special equipment options granted by cores.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Additional Content Variety</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow even stronger through various additional content!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You must also prepare for the endless rifts that await at the end.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Defeat Mekanions, the mechanical lifeforms consuming the entire world!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a new recruit of &quot;Clan,&quot; a global organization. The Clan's mission is to eliminate Mekanions—mechanically-infested lifeforms appearing in dungeons that have emerged across the world!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow stronger by learning skills at your Clan branch, crafting custom equipment, and completing various missions! The stronger you become, the more powerful Mekanions you will face.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Growth System Through Missions</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Accept and complete missions from various NPCs at your Clan branch to accumulate accolades.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you reach certain accolade thresholds, your Agent Rank increases along with your stats and skill points.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Additionally, completing specific missions unlocks new regions, sectors, and dungeons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dungeon Clearing Gameplay Structure</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you clear each dungeon, you obtain contribution, credits, cores, and materials.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Custom Equipment</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft your own unique equipment using materials obtained from defeating Mekanions and rare cores.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The performance of your crafted equipment increases based on the materials and cores used, and you gain special options.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diverse Skill Combinations</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Express your unique character through various choices within the skill tree divided into common skills and weapon skills!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can further enhance your unique style through special equipment options granted by cores.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Additional Content Variety</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow even stronger through various additional content!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You must also prepare for the endless rifts that await at the end.</p>", "short_description": "Defeat Mekanions, the mechanical lifeforms consuming the entire world!", "supported_languages": "English, Japanese, Korean, Simplified Chinese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3878420/7a95aef1317bd1c1f352acac6312566c7949299d/header.jpg?t=1774285714", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3878420/d41ed01ee9248aa5228b53d644aec01d71cd1ebb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774285714", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3878420/d41ed01ee9248aa5228b53d644aec01d71cd1ebb/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774285714", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system